	)
	(text "Section 1 drives ADC 0..3 (group A), section 2 ADC 4..7 (group B), 33 R series at the driver.\n10k pull-ups hold all four inputs high while the FPGA is unconfigured: converters idle and deselected,\nno floating CMOS inputs.\nDOUT/RDY returns unbuffered from each converter (33 R at the converter, channel sheet)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 384 324 0)
